  "translationRepairs": [
    ["s0168","idiomatic","Ministry and board officials were limited to: first, from Reader of the Grand Secretariat through Grand Secretary and above;","Ministry and board officials were limited to: first, from Readers of the Grand Secretariat down through Secretaries of the Grand Secretariat and above;","內閣侍讀學士以下，中書以上 sets the band from Grand Secretariat Readers down to 中書 (內閣中書). Grand Secretary is 大學士, not 中書; the proposal restores the correct office and keeps the X以下…Y以上 range.","high","applied"],
    ["s0168","literal","Ministry and board officials were limited to the following offices: one, from Reader of the Grand Secretariat down through Grand Secretary and above;","Ministry and board officials were limited to the following offices: one, from Readers of the Grand Secretariat down through Secretaries of the Grand Secretariat and above;","The literal likewise renders 中書 as Grand Secretary; Secretaries of the Grand Secretariat matches Qing 內閣中書, and the rest already tracks 以下…以上.","high","applied"],
    ["s0074","literal","One, princes of the imperial clan and hereditary noble ranks of duke and marquis;","One, princes of the imperial clan and hereditary noble ranks of prince and duke;","宗室王、公世爵 is wang and gong (prince and duke). Duke and marquis would be 公、侯; the idiomatic already has prince and duke, so the literal must match.","high","applied"],
    ["s0082","literal","Fixed quotas: sixteen for princes of the imperial clan and hereditary noble ranks of duke and marquis, twelve for Manchu and Han hereditary noble ranks, fourteen for princes and hereditary noble ranks of the outer dependencies, six for imperial clan and gioro members, thirty-two for ministry and board officials, ten for eminent scholars, ten for large taxpayers.","Fixed quotas: sixteen for princes of the imperial clan and hereditary noble ranks of prince and duke, twelve for Manchu and Han hereditary noble ranks, fourteen for princes and hereditary noble ranks of the outer dependencies, six for imperial clan and gioro members, thirty-two for ministry and board officials, ten for eminent scholars, ten for large taxpayers.","定額 repeats 宗室王、公世爵; duke and marquis is the same 王、公 error as in s0074, and prince and duke aligns with the Chinese and with the idiomatic quotas line.","high","applied"],
    ["s0284","idiomatic","The winning threshold was half the quotient of district quota divided by total electors.","The winning threshold was half the quotient of total electors divided by the district winner quota.","以本區應出當選人額數除選舉人總數 uses the winner quota as divisor of the elector total (electors÷quota); the prior idiomatic inverted dividend and divisor, and the proposed half-quotient threshold restores that arithmetic.","high","applied"],
    ["s0284","literal","Dividing the district's quota of winners by the total number of electors and taking half the quotient gave the winning vote threshold.","Dividing the total number of electors by the district's quota of winners and taking half the quotient gave the winning vote threshold.","The literal has the same inverted division; 以A除B here is electors divided by the district winner quota, then halved for 當選票額.","high","applied"],
    ["s0294","idiomatic","Appeals from primary judgments went to the surveillance commissioner; appeals from indirect judgments went to the Board of Punishments.","Appeals from primary judgments went to the surveillance commissioner; appeals from indirect judgments went to the Supreme Court (Daliyuan).","複選得向大理院上控 names the late-Qing 大理院 (Supreme Court), not 刑部 / Board of Punishments; the proposal corrects only that institution.","high","applied"],
    ["s0294","literal","Those dissatisfied with judgments: primary cases might appeal to the provincial surveillance commissioner; indirect cases might appeal to the Board of Punishments.","Those dissatisfied with judgments: primary cases might appeal to the provincial surveillance commissioner; indirect cases might appeal to the Supreme Court (Daliyuan).","The literal likewise substitutes Board of Punishments for 大理院; Supreme Court (Daliyuan) is the accurate late-Qing rendering, with the rest of the appeal path unchanged.","high","applied"],
    ["s0310","literal","The regent prince acting as regent attended in the sovereign's place, issued an instruction commending and encouraging the members.","The Prince Regent attended in the sovereign's place and issued an instruction commending and encouraging the members.","監國攝政王 is the title Prince Regent; 代行蒞選 means he attended in the sovereign's place. 'Regent prince acting as regent' is redundant and obscure; the proposed literal matches the idiomatic and the Chinese.","medium","applied"]
  ],
